#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Lock editing while a source is with the peer reviewers, so their catches (and their ratings) cannot be changed by later edits.
Also: every edit and delete is logged with record, source and changed fields; every peer round is kept in the log; an admin
return reopens only the returned records. Run from the repo root. Safe to run twice."""
